    ("distribute", "/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt/", "/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt/", "v. 分配，分发；使分布，散布；分销", "to give shares of something; to deal out; to spread throughout a space or area", ["allocate", "dispense", "circulate", "spread"], "In shuffle mode, the algorithm distributes high-frequency words evenly across all lists.", "在乱序模式下，算法将高频词均匀分配到各个词表中。", "词根：dis(分开)+tribut(给予)+e → 分发给每个人 → 分配，分布", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan"], 4),
    ("diverse", "/daɪˈvɜːs/", "/daɪˈvɜːrs/", "adj. 多种多样的，形形色色的，不同的", "showing a great deal of variety; very different", ["varied", "manifold", "assorted", "multifarious"], "Our learners have diverse goals ranging from graduate entrance exams to academic reading.", "我们的学习者有着从考研到学术阅读等多种多样的学习目标。", "词根：di(分开)+vers(转)+e → 朝不同方向转 → 多样的，不同的", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("divert", "/daɪˈvɜːt/", "/daɪˈvɜːrt/", "v. 使转向，使改道；转移（注意力或资金）；使消遣", "to cause someone or something to change course or turn from one direction to another", ["redirect", "deflect", "distract", "sidetrack"], "Minimalist design ensures that decorative elements never divert your attention from the word.", "极简设计确保装饰元素绝不会分散你对单词本身的注意力。", "词根：di(偏离)+vert(转) → 转到别的路上 → 使转向，转移注意力", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("dominant", "/ˈdɒmɪnənt/", "/ˈdɑːmɪnənt/", "adj. 占主导地位的，占优势的；显性的", "most important, powerful, or influential", ["prevailing", "predominant", "ruling", "preeminent"], "Spaced repetition remains the dominant paradigm in evidence-based memory software.", "间隔重复仍然是循证记忆软件中占主导地位的范式。", "词根：domin(统治/主人)+ant → 处于统治地位的 → 占主导地位的", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("drastic", "/ˈdræstɪk/", "/ˈdræstɪk/", "adj. 激烈的，猛烈的，大刀阔斧的，极端的", "likely to have a strong or far-reaching effect; radical and extreme", ["radical", "sweeping", "severe", "extreme"], "Removing mastered words brings a drastic reduction in daily review time.", "剔除已掌握的熟词能大幅缩减每日的复习耗时。", "助记：drast(做/行动)+ic → 采取雷厉风行行动的 → 大刀阔斧的，猛烈的", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan"], 5),
    ("durable", "/ˈdjʊərəbl/", "/ˈdʊrəbl/", "adj. 耐用的，持久的，长久的", "able to withstand wear, pressure, or damage; hard-wearing and long-lasting", ["lasting", "enduring", "resilient", "sturdy"], "Combining visual cards, audio dictation, and active spelling creates durable memory traces.", "将视觉卡片、听写和主动拼写相结合能形成持久的记忆痕迹。", "词根：dur(持续/坚硬)+able → 能够长久持续的 → 耐用的，持久的", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan"], 4),
    ("dynamic", "/daɪˈnæmɪk/", "/daɪˈnæmɪk/", "adj. 动态的；充满活力的；n. 动力，相互作用力", "characterized by constant change, activity, or progress; energetic", ["energetic", "vibrant", "fluid", "adaptive"], "The dynamic schedule adjusts automatically whenever you reset or customize your list count.", "每当你重置或自定义 List 数量时，动态计划表都会自动调整。", "词根：dynam(力量/动力)+ic → 有内在驱动力的 → 动态的，充满活力的", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
    ("elaborate", "/ɪˈlæbərət/", "/ɪˈlæbərət/", "adj. 精心制作的，详尽的，复杂的；v. 详细阐述，详尽说明", "involving many carefully arranged parts or details; to develop or present in detail", ["intricate", "detailed", "painstaking", "expound"], "Tap the dictionary button to elaborate on a word's etymology and collocations.", "点击词典按钮可详细展开单词的词源与搭配用法。", "词根：e(出)+labor(劳动)+ate → 花费大量心血做出来的 → 精巧详尽的；详细阐述", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("elevate", "/ˈelɪveɪt/", "/ˈelɪveɪt/", "v. 提升，提高，抬高；振奋（情绪）", "to raise or lift something to a higher position; to raise to a more important or impressive level", ["raise", "uplift", "promote", "heighten"], "Mastering core academic vocabulary will noticeably elevate your writing score.", "掌握核心学术词汇将显著提高你的写作得分。", "词根：e(出)+lev(轻/举起)+ate → 向上举起 → 提升，提高", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
    ("elicit", "/ɪˈlɪsɪt/", "/ɪˈlɪsɪt/", "v. 引出，诱出，探出（事实或反应）", "to evoke or draw out a reaction, answer, or fact from someone", ["evoke", "draw out", "extract", "prompt"], "Hiding the Chinese translation is designed to elicit active recall from your memory.", "隐藏中文释义旨在诱发你大脑的主动回忆。", "注意区分：elicit（引出、诱出，动词）vs illicit（非法的，形容词）", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("eliminate", "/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt/", "/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt/", "v. 消除，排除，淘汰，根除", "to completely remove or get rid of something", ["remove", "eradicate", "exclude", "weed out"], "Swipe left on any word you already know well to eliminate it from future study rounds.", "对任何你已经烂熟于心的单词向左滑动，即可将其从后续学习轮次中剔除。", "词根：e(出)+limin(门槛)+ate → 赶出门槛之外 → 淘汰，消除", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("elusive", "/ɪˈluːsɪv/", "/ɪˈluːsɪv/", "adj. 难以捉摸的，难懂的，易忘的，难以找到的", "difficult to find, catch, or achieve; difficult to remember or recall", ["evasive", "slippery", "fleeting", "intangible"], "The exact nuance of an elusive word becomes clear when seen in a vivid sentence.", "一个难以捉摸的词汇的微妙含义，在生动的例句中会变得清晰明了。", "词根：e(出)+lus(玩耍/溜走)+ive → 泥鳅一样溜走的 → 难以捉摸的，易忘的", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("emancipate", "/ɪˈmænsɪpeɪt/", "/ɪˈmænsɪpeɪt/", "v. 解放，使摆脱束缚，使获得自由", "to set free, especially from legal, social, or political restrictions", ["liberate", "free", "unshackle", "release"], "Offline capability emancipates learners from reliance on unstable network connections.", "离线能力将学习者从对不稳定网络连接的依赖中解放出来。", "词根：e(出)+man(手)+cip(抓)+ate → 从紧抓的手中放出来 → 解放", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
    ("embody", "/ɪmˈbɒdi/", "/ɪmˈbɑːdi/", "v. 体现，具体表现；包含，收录", "to be an expression of or give a tangible or visible form to an idea, quality, or feeling", ["personify", "exemplify", "manifest", "incorporate"], "Voca's interface is crafted to embody clarity, focus, and effortless efficiency.", "Voca的界面设计旨在体现清晰、专注与流畅高效。", "词根：em(使…)+body(身体/实体) → 赋予具体形体 → 体现，包含", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("embrace", "/ɪmˈbreɪs/", "/ɪmˈbreɪs/", "v./n. 拥抱；欣然接受，采纳；包含", "to hold closely in one's arms; to accept or support willingly and enthusiastically", ["welcome", "adopt", "espouse", "encompass"], "Successful learners embrace mistakes during spelling tests as opportunities to strengthen memory.", "成功的学习者欣然接受拼写测试中的错误，将其视为强化记忆的契机。", "词根：em(进入)+brace(双臂) → 揽入双臂之中 → 拥抱；欣然接受", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan"], 5),
    ("emerge", "/ɪˈmɜːdʒ/", "/ɪˈmɜːrdʒ/", "v. 浮现，出现；显露，为人所知；摆脱出来", "to move out of or away from something and come into view; to become apparent", ["appear", "surface", "arise", "transpire"], "Clear patterns of progress emerge after just seven days of Ebbinghaus review.", "仅仅经过七天的艾宾浩斯复习，清晰的进步轨迹就会显现出来。", "词根：e(出)+merg(沉没)+e → 从水中浮出水面 → 浮现，出现", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("empirical", "/ɪmˈpɪrɪkl/", "/ɪmˈpɪrɪkl/", "adj. 实证的，以经验或实验为依据的", "based on, concerned with, or verifiable by observation or experience rather than theory or pure logic", ["experimental", "observational", "practical", "verifiable"], "Every conclusion in our technical report is grounded in empirical verification.", "我们技术报告中的每一项结论都建立在实证验证的基础之上。", "考研核心学术词：常与 theoretical（理论上的）对比出现，意为“实证的、实验验证的”", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("emulate", "/ˈemjuleɪt/", "/ˈemjuleɪt/", "v. 效仿，模仿并赶超；仿真，模拟", "to match or surpass a person or achievement, typically by imitation", ["imitate", "rival", "follow", "simulate"], "While drawing inspiration from classic apps, Voca does not merely emulate them.", "在汲取经典应用灵感的同时，Voca 并非简单地模仿它们。", "词根：emul(竞争/赶超)+ate → 在学习借鉴中力求超越 → 效仿，仿真", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
    ("encompass", "/ɪnˈkʌmpəs/", "/ɪnˈkʌmpəs/", "v. 包含，涵盖，包括；包围，环绕", "to surround and have or hold within; to include comprehensively", ["include", "comprise", "embrace", "surround"], "The built-in lexicons encompass CET-4, CET-6, Postgraduate, and Academic English.", "内置词库涵盖了四级、六级、考研和学术英语词汇。", "词根：en(进入)+compass(罗盘/范围) → 纳入罗盘范围之内 → 包含，涵盖", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("endeavor", "/ɪnˈdevə(r)/", "/ɪnˈdevər/", "v./n. 努力，尽力，竭力；事业，尝试", "to try hard to do or achieve something; an attempt to achieve a goal", ["strive", "aspire", "undertaking", "enterprise"], "Mastering a foreign language is a rewarding lifelong endeavor.", "掌握一门外语是一项回报丰厚的终身事业。", "助记：en(使)+deavor(职责) → 尽心尽力履行职责 → 努力，事业", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("endow", "/ɪnˈdaʊ/", "/ɪnˈdaʊ/", "v. 赋予，赐予（天生能力或特质）；向…捐钱（设立基金）", "to provide with a quality, ability, or asset; to give or bequeath an income or property to", ["bestow", "equip", "bless", "fund"], "Human beings are endowed with a remarkable capacity for associative memory.", "人类天生具备非凡的联想记忆能力。", "常考搭配：be endowed with...（天生具有…，被赋予…）", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("endure", "/ɪnˈdjʊə(r)/", "/ɪnˈdʊr/", "v. 忍受，忍耐；持久，持续存在", "to suffer something painful or difficult patiently; to remain in existence; to last", ["withstand", "tolerate", "persevere", "last"], "Knowledge acquired through spaced active recall will endure for years.", "通过间隔主动回忆获得的知识将持久保留多年。", "词根：en(使)+dur(持久/坚硬)+e → 经受住考验持续下去 → 忍耐；持久", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan"], 4),
    ("enhance", "/ɪnˈhɑːns/", "/ɪnˈhæns/", "v. 提高，增强，增进（价值、质量或吸引力）", "to intensify, increase, or further improve the quality, value, or extent of", ["improve", "augment", "elevate", "boost"], "Bilingual example sentences and audio pronunciation greatly enhance memory retention.", "双语例句与语音朗读极大地增强了记忆留存率。", "词根：en(使)+hanc(高)+e → 使推向更高水平 → 提高，增强", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("enlightenment", "/ɪnˈlaɪtnmənt/", "/ɪnˈlaɪtnmənt/", "n. 启迪，启发，开导；启蒙运动", "the action of enlightening or the state of being enlightened; spiritual or intellectual awakening", ["illumination", "insight", "edification", "awakening"], "Reading philosophical classics brings intellectual enlightenment and critical perspective.", "阅读哲学经典能带来智识上的启迪与批判性视角。", "词根：en(使)+light(光)+en+ment → 照亮心灵驱散蒙昧 → 启迪，启蒙", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
    ("entail", "/ɪnˈteɪl/", "/ɪnˈteɪl/", "v. 牵涉，需要，使成为必要；蕴含", "to involve something as a necessary or inevitable part or consequence", ["involve", "require", "necessitate", "demand"], "Building reliable dual-platform software entails rigorous testing and data validation.", "开发可靠的双平台软件需要严格的测试与数据验证。", "考研高频词：A entails B 意为“A必然伴随/需要B”", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("entity", "/ˈentəti/", "/ˈentəti/", "n. 实体，独立存在物；组织，机构", "a thing with distinct and independent existence", ["organization", "body", "unit", "being"], "In database design, each vocabulary word is modeled as an independent entity.", "在数据库设计中，每个词汇都被建模为一个独立的实体。", "词根：ent(存在)+ity → 客观实在之物 → 实体", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("enumerate", "/ɪˈnjuːməreɪt/", "/ɪˈnuːməreɪt/", "v. 列举，枚举，逐一清点", "to mention a number of things one by one", ["list", "itemize", "catalog", "recount"], "The documentation enumerates all supported import file formats and keyboard shortcuts.", "文档逐一列举了所有受支持的导入文件格式和键盘快捷键。", "词根：e(出)+numer(数字)+ate → 按数字一个个点出来 → 列举，枚举", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
    ("envision", "/ɪnˈvɪʒn/", "/ɪnˈvɪʒn/", "v. 设想，展望，想象（未来蓝图）", "to imagine as a future possibility; to visualize", ["foresee", "envisage", "conceive", "picture"], "We envision Voca as a lifelong companion for independent language learners.", "我们将 Voca 设想为自主语言学习者的终身伴侣。", "词根：en(进入)+vision(视界/愿景) → 在脑海中描绘愿景 → 展望，设想", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("ephemeral", "/ɪˈfemərəl/", "/ɪˈfemərəl/", "adj. 短暂的，转瞬即逝的，朝生暮死的", "lasting for a very short time", ["fleeting", "transient", "short-lived", "evanescent"], "Without Ebbinghaus review, cramming before an exam produces only ephemeral memory.", "如果没有艾宾浩斯式的复习，考前突击只能产生转瞬即逝的短暂记忆。", "词根：epi(在…期间)+hemer(一天)+al → 只活一天的 → 转瞬即逝的", ["kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("equilibrium", "/ˌiːkwɪˈlɪbriəm/", "/ˌiːkwɪˈlɪbriəm/", "n. 平衡，均衡；心理平静", "a state in which opposing forces or influences are balanced", ["balance", "symmetry", "stability", "poise"], "An effective study plan maintains an equilibrium between new words and review tasks.", "高效的学习计划在新学词汇与复习任务之间保持均衡。", "词根：equi(相等)+libr(天平/重量)+ium → 天平两端重量相等 → 平衡，均衡", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("equivalent", "/ɪˈkwɪvələnt/", "/ɪˈkwɪvələnt/", "adj. 相等的，等价的，等效的；n. 对等物，对应词", "equal in value, amount, function, meaning, etc.", ["equal", "comparable", "counterpart", "tantamount"], "Not every English word has a single exact one-to-one equivalent in Chinese.", "并非每个英语单词在汉语中都有唯一完全对应的词。", "词根：equi(相等)+val(价值)+ent → 价值完全相等的 → 等价的；对应词", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("eradicate", "/ɪˈrædɪkeɪt/", "/ɪˈrædɪkeɪt/", "v. 根除，根绝，彻底消灭", "to destroy completely; to put an end to", ["eliminate", "exterminate", "uproot", "abolish"], "Repeated spelling challenges help eradicate stubborn spelling mistakes.", "反复的拼写挑战有助于根除顽固的拼写错误。", "词根：e(出)+radic(根)+ate → 连根拔起 → 根除，杜绝", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("erroneous", "/ɪˈrəʊniəs/", "/ɪˈroʊniəs/", "adj. 错误的，不正确的", "wrong; incorrect; based on mistaken belief", ["incorrect", "mistaken", "fallacious", "inaccurate"], "The system immediately highlights erroneous letters in red during spelling mode.", "在拼词模式中，系统会立即用红色高亮显示错误的字母。", "词根：err(错误)+oneous → 犯错的 → 错误的，不正确的", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
    ("escalate", "/ˈeskəleɪt/", "/ˈeskəleɪt/", "v. （使）逐步升级，（使）加剧，不断恶化", "to increase rapidly; to become or cause to become more intense or serious", ["intensify", "mount", "spiral", "heighten"], "If you skip three days of review, your backlog of unreviewed lists will quickly escalate.", "如果你跳过三天的复习，积压的未复习词表就会迅速增加。", "助记：来自 escalator（自动扶梯）→ 像坐扶梯一样层层升高 → 升级，加剧", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("essential", "/ɪˈsenʃl/", "/ɪˈsenʃl/", "adj. 必不可少的，极其重要的；本质的；n. 要素，必需品", "absolutely necessary; extremely important; fundamental", ["indispensable", "vital", "fundamental", "requisite"], "Local data persistence is essential for a truly offline vocabulary application.", "本地数据持久化对于真正离线的背单词应用来说是必不可少的。", "词根：ess(存在/本质)+ent+ial → 构成事物本质的 → 本质的，必不可少的", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan"], 5),
