    ("evaluate", "/ɪˈvæljueɪt/", "/ɪˈvæljueɪt/", "v. 评估，评价；求…的值", "to form an idea of the amount, number, or value of; to assess", ["assess", "appraise", "gauge", "estimate"], "Self-testing in single-language mode lets you honestly evaluate your familiarity.", "在单语模式下自测能让你诚实地评估自己对单词的熟悉程度。", "词根：e(出)+valu(价值)+ate → 评定出某物的价值 → 评估，评价", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
