    ("exemplify", "/ɪɡˈzemplɪfaɪ/", "/ɪɡˈzemplɪfaɪ/", "v. 是…的典范（或典型）；举例说明", "to be a typical example of; to give an example of; to illustrate by giving examples", ["illustrate", "epitomize", "embody", "demonstrate"], "Well-chosen sentences exemplify how a word functions in real communication.", "精选的例句能够举例说明单词在真实交流中是如何运用的。", "词根：exempl(榜样/例子)+ify(使…) → 用例子加以说明；成为典范", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
