    ("exploit", "/ɪkˈsplɔɪt/", "/ɪkˈsplɔɪt/", "v. 开发，利用，发挥；剥削；n. 英勇事迹，功绩", "to make full use of and derive benefit from a resource; to use unfairly", ["utilize", "harness", "leverage", "capitalize on"], "Voca exploits the spacing effect of human memory to maximize learning efficiency.", "Voca 充分利用人类记忆的间隔效应，将学习效率最大化。", "考研高频词：中性义为“开发、充分利用（资源/机制）”，贬义为“剥削”", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
