    ("feasible", "/ˈfiːzəbl/", "/ˈfiːzəbl/", "adj. 可行的，行得通的，办得到的", "possible to do easily or conveniently; likely or probable", ["practicable", "viable", "workable", "achievable"], "Dividing 3,000 words into 15 manageable lists makes the 30-day goal completely feasible.", "将3000词划分为15个易于管理的词表，使30天攻克目标完全可行。", "词根：feas(做)+ible → 能够做得到的 → 可行的", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
