    ("harness", "/ˈhɑːnɪs/", "/ˈhɑːrnɪs/", "v. 控制并利用（自然力或资源）；给（马）套挽具；n. 挽具，安全带", "to control and make use of natural resources or power to produce energy or achieve a result", ["utilize", "exploit", "channel", "mobilize"], "Voca harnesses the Ebbinghaus forgetting curve to schedule optimal review intervals.", "Voca 利用艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线来规划最佳的复习间隔。", "助记：原指给骏马套上马具使其拉车，引申为“驾驭、有效利用（力量/规律）”", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
