    ("illuminate", "/ɪˈluːmɪneɪt/", "/ɪˈluːmɪneɪt/", "v. 照亮，照明；阐明，启发，使清晰易懂", "to light up; to help to clarify or explain a subject or matter", ["clarify", "elucidate", "enlighten", "brighten"], "Etymological notes illuminate the hidden connections between seemingly unrelated words.", "词源注释阐明了看似无关的单词之间隐藏的内在联系。", "词根：il(进入)+lumin(光)+ate → 把光投射进去 → 照亮；阐明，启发", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
