    ("imperative", "/ɪmˈperətɪv/", "/ɪmˈperətɪv/", "adj. 势在必行的，极其重要的，必要的；祈使的；n. 必要的事，当务之急", "of vital importance; crucial; giving an authoritative command", ["vital", "essential", "urgent", "mandatory"], "Protecting user data across software updates is an absolute imperative.", "在软件升级过程中保护用户数据完整是绝对的当务之急。", "词根：im+per(命令/帝王)+ative → 如同皇命般必须执行的 → 势在必行的；祈使语气", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
