    ("intelligible", "/ɪnˈtelɪdʒəbl/", "/ɪnˈtelɪdʒəbl/", "adj. 可理解的，清晰易懂的，明白的", "able to be understood; comprehensible", ["comprehensible", "understandable", "lucid", "clear"], "Technical architecture guides should be written in clear, intelligible prose.", "技术架构指南应当用清晰易懂的语言编写。", "词根：intel(在…之间)+lig(选择/读)+ible → 能够读懂理解的 → 清晰易懂的", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
