    ("intuitive", "/ɪnˈtjuːɪtɪv/", "/ɪnˈtuːɪtɪv/", "adj. 直觉的；直观易用的，无需教程即懂的", "using or based on what one feels to be true even without conscious reasoning; easy to understand or operate without explicit instruction", ["instinctive", "natural", "user-friendly", "self-explanatory"], "Swipe gestures and keyboard shortcuts make Voca's interface immediately intuitive.", "滑动手势与键盘快捷键使 Voca 的界面直观易用。", "词根：in(向内)+tuit(看/守护)+ive → 内心一眼看穿的 → 直觉的；直观易用的", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
