    ("manifest", "/ˈmænɪfest/", "/ˈmænɪfest/", "v. 表明，清楚显示，显现；adj. 明显的，显而易见的；n. 载货单", "to display or show a quality or feeling by one's acts or appearance; clear or obvious to the eye or mind", ["demonstrate", "exhibit", "evident", "apparent"], "The benefits of the 1-2-4-7-15 review cycle manifest clearly during final exam preparation.", "1-2-4-7-15复习周期的益处在期末备考阶段会清晰地显现出来。", "词根：mani(手)+fest(打击/抓到) → 当场抓在手里无可抵赖 → 明显的；表明", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
