    ("prominent", "/ˈprɒmɪnənt/", "/ˈprɑːmɪnənt/", "adj. 著名的，杰出的；突出的，显眼的", "important; famous; projecting from something; protuberant", ["eminent", "distinguished", "conspicuous", "salient"], "The language mode switcher is placed in a prominent position on the main toolbar.", "中英模式切换按钮被放置在主工具栏的显眼位置上。", "词根：pro(向前)+min(伸出/突出)+ent → 向前凸出来的 → 突出的，显眼的，杰出的", ["cet4", "cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
    ("propagate", "/ˈprɒpəɡeɪt/", "/ˈprɑːpəɡeɪt/", "v. 传播，宣传，普及；繁殖，增殖", "to spread and promote an idea, theory, etc. widely; to breed specimens of a plant or animal", ["disseminate", "spread", "circulate", "promulgate"], "Edits made to a word inside the starred notebook automatically propagate to the main lexicon view.", "在生词本中对单词释义所做的修改会自动同步传递到主词库视图中。", "词根：pro(向前)+pag(插条/固定)+ate → 把枝条插下去繁衍传开 → 传播，繁殖", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
    ("reciprocate", "/rɪˈsɪprəkeɪt/", "/rɪˈsɪprəkeɪt/", "v. 回报，酬答，投桃报李；往复运动", "to respond to a gesture or action by making a corresponding one", ["return", "repay", "requite", "retaliate"], "Your brain will reciprocate your consistent study effort with effortless reading comprehension.", "你的大脑将以轻松自如的阅读理解力来回报你持之以恒的学习付出。", "词根：re(向后)+ciproc(向后)+ate → 有来有往 → 回报，互惠", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 4),
