    ("redundant", "/rɪˈdʌndənt/", "/rɪˈdʌndənt/", "adj. 多余的，累赘的；被裁员的；冗余的", "not or no longer needed or useful; superfluous", ["superfluous", "unnecessary", "surplus", "excess"], "Marking known words as mastered eliminates redundant repetition of vocabulary you already know.", "将认识的词标记为熟词，可以消除对已知词汇的多余重复。", "词根：red(反复)+und(波浪)+ant → 波浪一层又一层涌来过多 → 多余的，冗余的", ["cet6", "kaoyan", "academic"], 5),
